---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Enterprise Home Lab"
	description="Enterprise-grade home lab environment built on Dell PowerEdge servers for network simulation and infrastructure testing"
>
	<p>
		This lab started with a decommissioned Dell PowerEdge R730 server generously donated by Auto-Chlor System. 
		I rescued this hardware from a future at an e-waste facility and turned it into the foundation of a dedicated, 
		enterprise-grade testing environment. Since then, it has grown into a multi-host setup that allows me to 
		simulate production-level infrastructure at home.
	</p>

	<h2>Hardware</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="1"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Host 1 — Dell PowerEdge R730</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">CPU</td><td>2x Intel Xeon E5-2637 v3 @ 3.50GHz (16 Threads)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">RAM</td><td>64 GB DDR4 ECC</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Storage</td><td>100 GB (93.93 GiB)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">OS</td><td>Proxmox VE</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Role</td><td>Virtualization & network simulation</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Origin</td><td>Donated by Auto-Chlor System</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="1"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Host 2 — Dell PowerEdge R740</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">CPU</td><td>2x Intel Xeon Gold 6242 @ 2.80GHz (64 Threads)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">RAM</td><td>512 GB DDR4 ECC</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Storage</td><td>3 TB ZFS Pool (Highly Efficient)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">OS</td><td>Proxmox VE</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Role</td><td>Primary workload server</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 22 13.5C22 9.5 19 6.5 15 6.5c-1 0-2 .2-3 .6A8.5 8.5 0 0 0 3 14c0 3.5 2.5 6.5 6 6.5h8.5Z"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Cloud Storage Integration:</strong> Both host servers have <code>rclone</code> configured to mount cloud storage drives directly to the filesystem. This integrates <strong>5 TB of Google Drive</strong> and <strong>6 TB of Microsoft 365 Business</strong> storage (split into 1 TB per sub-account), providing highly resilient off-site storage for backups and media.
		</span>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Network Backbone:</strong> The two hosts are interconnected via a high-speed <strong>10 Gbps bonded connection</strong>, configured for link aggregation to achieve up to <strong>20 Gbps of aggregate throughput</strong>.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>What It Runs</h2>

	<p>
		The lab serves as a sandbox for building, breaking, and rebuilding infrastructure without impacting 
		production environments. Day-to-day, it supports:
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li><strong>Virtualized infrastructure</strong> — running multiple VMs and containers to mirror enterprise topologies</li>
		<li><strong>Network simulation</strong> — testing complex routing, switching, firewall, and VPN configurations</li>
		<li><strong>Security testing</strong> — practicing hardening, monitoring, and incident response workflows</li>
		<li><strong>Automation development</strong> — prototyping Ansible playbooks, Python scripts, and CI/CD pipelines</li>
		<li><strong>Continuous learning</strong> — preparing for certifications and experimenting with new technologies</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Future Plans</h2>

	<p>
		I'm working on documenting the full lab configuration as Infrastructure as Code (IaC). Once ready, the 
		complete setup — including provisioning scripts, network configs, and automation playbooks — will be 
		published as an open-source repository.
	</p>

	<div class="github-teaser">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.012 8.012 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
		<span>IaC repository coming soon — follow <a href="https://github.com/sYnVerse" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@sYnVerse</a> on GitHub</span>
	</div>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Proxmox</span>
		<span class="tag">pfSense</span>
		<span class="tag">Docker</span>
		<span class="tag">Ansible</span>
		<span class="tag">VLAN</span>
		<span class="tag">Dell PowerEdge</span>
		<span class="tag">rclone</span>
		<span class="tag">Google Drive</span>
		<span class="tag">Microsoft 365</span>
		<span class="tag">ZFS</span>
		<span class="tag">Link Aggregation</span>
		<span class="tag">10G/20G Bonding</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.github-teaser {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}

	.github-teaser svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
